</element-citation></ref></ref-list><sec><title>Authors' Contribution: </title><p>RM: Conception and design, editing of the manuscript, data collection, analysis, and revision of the manuscript; HM: Editing of the manuscript, data collection, analysis, and revision of the manuscript; AK: Data collection, analysis, and revision of manuscript; MH: Editing, data collection, analysis, and revision of the manuscript; MA: Study design, data collection, analysis, and revision of the manuscript. All authors have read and approved the final manuscript.</p></sec><sec><title>Clinical Trial Registration Code: </title><p>The study was registered at the ClinicalTrials.gov (Clinical Trial ID: NCT05774249) on March 20, 2023.</p></sec><sec sec-type="COI-statement"><title>Conflict of Interests: </title><p>The authors declared that they have no competing interests.</p></sec><sec sec-type="data-availability" id="s4"><title>Data Availability: </title><p>The data sets generated during and/or analyzed during the current study are available from the corresponding author upon reasonable request.</p></sec><sec><title>Ethical Approval: </title><p>In this study, the research protocol was approved by the Ethics Committee of Ain Shams University (FMASU R 34/2023). The research procedures conducted in this study were in accordance with the ethical standards set by the institutional ethics committee and are consistent with the principles outlined in the 1964 Helsinki Declaration and its subsequent amendments or comparable ethical guidelines.</p></sec><sec><title>Funding/Support: </title><p>Authors declared there is no funding for this article.</p></sec><sec><title>Informed Consent: </title><p>Before surgery, all legally authorized representatives of the patients provided written informed consent indicating their voluntary participation and understanding of the study objectives, procedures, and potential risks.</p></sec></back></article>